# Generated by scripts/gen_all_results.py: every exercise's solution
# (all_results.md) plus the vault it's rendered from for professional/
# genius (private_solutions.json, since those two tiers' own
# exercises/*.json no longer carries ideal_keystrokes at all — see
# server/exercises.py's list_exercises() for the corresponding API-side
# redaction). Kept out of the repo entirely, not just out of the UI.
private/

# Deployment
# .env holds machine-specific overrides (see .env.example, which IS
# committed, for what's available) — never the same across deployments,
# so never one to commit.
.env
